WEBVTT

01:16:31.036 --> 01:16:33.079
Gee, I'd better shave.

01:16:37.793 --> 01:16:39.168
Come in, Frankincense.

01:16:39.253 --> 01:16:41.254
Andy is now opening
his first present.

01:16:41.338 --> 01:16:44.131
-It's...
-Buzz. Buzz Lightyear,

01:16:44.216 --> 01:16:46.175
-you are not worried, are you?
-I can't quite...

01:16:46.260 --> 01:16:47.677
-Me? No, no.
-Make out...

01:16:47.761 --> 01:16:50.429
No. No, no, no, no.

01:16:50.514 --> 01:16:52.848
A large box... It's...

01:16:52.933 --> 01:16:55.518
-Are you?
-Now, Buzz,

01:16:55.602 --> 01:16:59.855
what could Andy possibly get
that is worse than you?
